`class` 单继承；类方法隐式持有 `self`；父类构造用 `super.init(...)`。

```ds
package demo

class Animal {
    name: str
    fn new(name: str) { self.name = name }
    fn speak(self) -> str { "..." }
}

class Dog extends Animal {
    fn new(name: str) { super.init(name) }
    fn speak(self) -> str { "woof" }
}

fn main() {
    let d = Dog.new("rex")
    println(d.speak())
}
```

`trait` 定义接口，`impl Trait for 类型` 实现；`dyn Trait` 是动态派发对象。

```ds
package demo

trait Draw {
    fn draw(ref self) -> str
}

type Circle { r: f32 }

impl Draw for Circle {
    fn draw(ref self) -> str { "circle" }
}

fn main() {
    let c = Circle(r: 1.0)
    println(c.draw())
}
```

