`spawn` 启动结构化任务（作用域结束自动 wait）；`chan[T]`/`send`/`recv` 通信。

```ds
package demo

fn worker(ch: chan[i32]) {
    send ch, 42
}

fn main() {
    let ch = chan[i32](4)
    spawn { worker(ch) }
    match recv ch {
        some(v) => println("got " + str(v)),
        none => println("closed"),
    }
}
```

共享可变状态必须经 `mutex`；`wait 句柄` 等待任务/线程完成。

```ds
package demo

fn job() { }

fn main() {
    let m = mutex(0)
    {
        let guard = m.lock()
        _ = guard
    }
    let t = thread(job)
    wait t
}
```

五选一：栈/静态、`alloc`+`free`、`rc[T]`、`arc[T]`、`gc[T]`；`ref` 是受检借用，`ptr`/`raw` 只能在 `@unsafe` 中解引用。

```ds
package demo

fn main() {
    let p = alloc(16, 8)
    @unsafe { *p = 65 }
    free(p)

    let a = rc(1)
    let b = arc(mutex(0))
    let c = gc(2)
    _ = a
    _ = b
    _ = c
}
```

`--bare` 下无 OS/GC；用 `section ".boot"` 放入口，`@irq(n) irq fn` 声明中断服务例程，`volatile ptr[u32]` 访问 MMIO。

```ds
package firmware

section ".boot" {
    fn reset() at 0x0000_0000 {
        loop { @unsafe { asm "wfi" } }
    }
}

@irq(5)
